[case_guidance] case_id | kind | ordinal | item
"C-92ebcdd20a" | "avoid" | 0 | "Moving only the switch into a helper that still exposes concrete implementation details to the caller."
"C-92ebcdd20a" | "avoid" | 1 | "Wrapping the concrete implementations in another facade solely to reduce the finding."
"C-92ebcdd20a" | "avoid" | 2 | "Renaming constructors, variables, or implementations."
"C-92ebcdd20a" | "avoid" | 3 | "Extracting branch bodies while leaving selection and collaboration in the same function."
"C-92ebcdd20a" | "lead" | 0 | "Consider moving implementation selection into a factory or composition boundary that returns the role."
"C-92ebcdd20a" | "lead" | 1 | "Consider accepting the role as a dependency instead of deciding which concrete player to use here."
"C-92ebcdd20a" | "lead" | 2 | "Keep collaboration expressed in terms of the role while centralizing knowledge of concrete implementations."
"C-92ebcdd20a" | "lead" | 3 | "The selected implementations already respond to the same required messages. Consider expressing that collaboration as a role owned by the consumer."

